BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//TermiWeb//Milestones//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:TermiWeb Milestones
X-WR-CALDESC:Milestone dates derived from docs/PLAN.md
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m1@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M1: Repository bootstrap and docs baseline
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260407
DESCRIPTION:Added the initial repo structure\, TypeScript/Vite/server scaff
 olding\, baseline docs (including the initial `AGENTS.md`/`CLAUDE.md` work
 ing agreement)\, and the first environment/runtime conventions. This is th
 e phase that created the project skeleton later milestones could actually
  build on.\nStart: 2026-04-06\nEnd: 2026-04-06
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m2@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M2: Shared terminal backend and session model
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260407
DESCRIPTION:Added the server-side PTY/session manager\, protocol\, auth/ses
 sion handling\, and lightweight workspace persistence. This is where insta
 nce creation\, attach/select\, close\, and shared terminal I/O became real
  code paths instead of placeholders.\nStart: 2026-04-06\nEnd: 2026-04-06
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m3@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M3: Browser UI with instances\, auth\, and mobile controls
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260406
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260407
DESCRIPTION:Added the browser client\, login flow\, instance rail\, xterm i
 ntegration\, and the first usable mobile control surface. By the end of th
 is phase\, desktop and phone clients could both attach to the same live in
 stance through the browser UI.\nStart: 2026-04-06\nEnd: 2026-04-06
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m4@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M4: Local verification and launch polish
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260407
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260408
DESCRIPTION:Added the first serious verification loop\, tightened restart/r
 econnect behavior\, and cleaned up the initial launch/run path enough for
  real local use. This is also where the project stopped feeling like a dev
 -only prototype and started behaving like an intentional app.\nStart: 2026
 -04-07\nEnd: 2026-04-07
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m5@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M5: 0.1 release polish and rendering integrity
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260408
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260418
DESCRIPTION:This milestone contains the major UI/layout refinements\, per-i
 nstance width controls\, mobile behavior fixes\, local viewport scrolling\
 , shared terminal geometry cleanup\, and the current follow-cursor work. I
 t closed after interactive CLI rendering held up in dogfooding and the ele
 vated-only run path passed live packaged verification.\nStart: 2026-04-08\
 nEnd: 2026-04-17
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m6@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M6: Installer and first-run experience
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260412
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260414
DESCRIPTION:Added packaging\, launch scripts\, optional startup-task auto-s
 tart\, uninstall\, distribution layout\, and first-run docs for a non-dev
  Windows install path. Verified fresh-machine setup\, before-sign-in auto-
 start\, uninstall cleanup\, and two-device shared session on real hardware
 .\nStart: 2026-04-12\nEnd: 2026-04-13
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m7@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M7: 0.1 release and GitHub Pages download website
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260419
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260424
DESCRIPTION:This milestone produced the tagged `0.1` release artifacts\, th
 e live `https://termiweb.com` download site\, the public GitHub release en
 try\, the canonical download path at `/download/`\, the private milestone-
 calendar feed\, and the launch-surface docs that now describe the shipped
  release honestly.\nStart: 2026-04-19\nEnd: 2026-04-23
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m8@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M8: Search and discovery foundation for an open-source\, free-to-us
 e product
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260424
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260427
DESCRIPTION:This milestone prepares the public surface without pushing broa
 d attention yet. It includes website search hygiene\, metadata\, sitemap/S
 earch Console setup\, GitHub discovery polish\, positioning decisions\, an
 d reusable announcement copy that can wait for the post-`0.1.1` outreach l
 ane.\nStart: 2026-04-24\nEnd: 2026-04-26
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m9@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M9: `0.1.1` mobile stabilization
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260427
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260502
DESCRIPTION:This milestone shipped `0.1.1`\, pulling the must-have mobile f
 ixes from Findings `13` and `14` into the release line while keeping relea
 se verification local and explicit for the current one-maintainer workflow
 .\nStart: 2026-04-27\nEnd: 2026-05-01
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m10@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M10: `0.1.2` Select fix\, Windows installer\, instance titles\, and
  bell
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260724
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260926
DESCRIPTION:This milestone ships `0.1.2` covering the mobile Select-mode re
 lease-blocker first\, then verification closure of the lingering `0.1.1` m
 obile stabilization issues\, a real Windows installer with a passwordless
  `SYSTEM` auto-start fix per [the Windows-installer spec](specs/windows-in
 staller.md)\, implementation of the instance-titles spec\, and a new bell-
 behavior spec plus implementation. Blocked by [#5 mobile Select](https://g
 ithub.com/n8bar/TermiWeb/issues/5) until that fix lands\; the rest of scop
 e follows behind it.\nStart: 2026-07-24\nTarget end: 2026-09-25
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m11@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M11: Post-`0.1.1` public outreach
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260925
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
DESCRIPTION:This milestone turns the M8 positioning and reusable copy into
  deliberate outreach once the `0.1.2` release has shipped\, so first impre
 ssions land on the improved install experience. It includes direct sharing
 \, feedback capture\, first public technical post preparation\, community-
 rule review\, and a later Product Hunt decision.\nStart: 2026-09-25\nTarge
 t end: 2026-10-09
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:termiweb-m12@termiweb.local
DTSTAMP:20260807T020048Z
SUMMARY:M12: `0.2`
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DESCRIPTION:This milestone ships the first `0.2` release. The QR connect af
 fordance is already pulled in as the easiest included feature candidate\,
  and the milestone leaves room to add other bounded `0.2` features before
  the release surface is locked.\nStart: 2026-10-09\nTarget end: 2026-11-06
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
